======================================================================================================================
L56 -- the potential-depth trigger: the one door L51 priced and declined to close
======================================================================================================================
    a0 footings: canonical 9.3619e-11 m/s^2, alt 1.1279e-10 m/s^2
    convention: ds^2 = -(1+2 Phi) dt^2 + (1-2 Psi) dx^2;  slip s = Phi - Psi;  gamma_PPN = Psi/Phi;
    lensing potential (Phi+Psi)/2.  Dimensionless potential X = |Phi|/c^2 throughout PART B onwards.

